  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/923/38/3d-de.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>推薦使用 OPTFINE</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fbusiness%253dLAEZJ6TS7CYP6%2526no_recurring%253d0%2526item_name%253dHelp%2bme%2bcontinue%2bwith%2bthe%2bprojects%2bwith%2ba%2bsimple%2bdonation%2b-%2bHeycronus%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"font-weight:400;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1013293/description_41c410a1-3705-48e1-9d6d-faca354f3234.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"93\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>⚠注意</strong>：自2026年1月8日起，Heycronus團隊的所有項目將正式發布並僅通過devHeycronus賬戶在CurseForge、Modrinth和Planet Minecraft上進行維護。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用<strong>Better 3D Craft</strong>紋理包增強您的遊戲體驗，為您的遊戲添加超過70個新的方塊和物品3D模型。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">我們以下列方塊為例：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-工作台</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-熔爐</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-南瓜</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-書架</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-礦石等...</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1291/574/sem-tatulo-2-png.png\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/891/973/all-blocks.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/891/974/all-itens.png\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
